{
  "id": "timeline-between",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Aralıktaki olaylar",
    "en": "Events in a window"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.py",
  "solution": "solution.py",
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Süzgeç: `start <= time <= end`.",
      "en": "The filter: `start <= time <= end`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`(saat, yol, tur)` demetlerini sırala, sonra satırı kur.",
      "en": "Sort `(time, path, kind)` tuples, then build the line."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef timeline_between(records, start, end):\n    chosen = sorted((time, path, kind) for path, kind, time in records if start <= time <= end)\n    return [f\"{time} {kind} {path}\" for time, path, kind in chosen]\n\nRECORDS = [\n    [\"/tmp/x.zip\", \"created\", \"02:17:40\"],\n    [\"/srv/data/customers.csv\", \"accessed\", \"02:19:58\"],\n    [\"/tmp/x.zip\", \"modified\", \"02:20:03\"],\n    [\"/var/log/auth.log\", \"modified\", \"01:05:00\"],\n    [\"/home/bob/.bash_history\", \"modified\", \"02:21:10\"],\n]\nfor line in timeline_between(RECORDS, \"02:18:00\", \"02:21:00\"):\n    print(line)\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef timeline_between(records, start, end):\n    chosen = sorted((time, path, kind) for path, kind, time in records if start <= time <= end)\n    return [f\"{time} {kind} {path}\" for time, path, kind in chosen]\n\nRECORDS = [\n    [\"/tmp/x.zip\", \"created\", \"02:17:40\"],\n    [\"/srv/data/customers.csv\", \"accessed\", \"02:19:58\"],\n    [\"/tmp/x.zip\", \"modified\", \"02:20:03\"],\n    [\"/var/log/auth.log\", \"modified\", \"01:05:00\"],\n    [\"/home/bob/.bash_history\", \"modified\", \"02:21:10\"],\n]\nfor line in timeline_between(RECORDS, \"02:18:00\", \"02:21:00\"):\n    print(line)\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "timeline_between",
      "cases": [
